# PlausiDen Sovereign Polyglot Stack — quarterly review reminder.
# Managed by PlausiDen-AVP-Doctrine.
#
# First Monday of Feb / May / Aug / Nov at 09:00 local. Walks every layer
# of SOVEREIGN_POLYGLOT_STACK.md and asks:
#   1. Has fitness shifted? (new language matured, old one regressed)
#   2. Has governance shifted? (relicense, vendor capture, foundation handoff)
#   3. Has a watch-list entry become production-ready?
#
# Output: ~/.local/share/plausiden/cron-state/sovereign-stack-review.log
# Also dispatches a notification so the maintainer can't silently miss it.

0 9 1-7 2,5,8,11 1 /usr/bin/env bash -lc 'bash /home/user/Development/PlausiDen/PlausiDen-AVP-Doctrine/scripts/sovereign-stack-review-reminder.sh >> ~/.local/share/plausiden/cron-state/sovereign-stack-review.log 2>&1'
